sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Student
    participant G as GraphQL Gateway
    participant M as MockRpcPorts
    participant T as Catalog Service
    participant DB as DB-T (PostgreSQL)
    User->>G: teachers(filter, page)
    G->>M: ValidateSession(token)
    Note over M: in-process, no gRPC
    M-->>G: actor, role
    G->>M: SearchTeachers(filter, page)
    M->>T: search_teachers(...)
    T->>DB: SELECT teachers + metrics
    DB-->>T: rows
    T-->>M: TeacherPage
    M-->>G: TeacherPage
    G-->>User: GraphQL data (selected fields)
